[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2162.31, "timestamp": "00:36:02", "text": "既然很难，为什么不作为一个团队尽力而为呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2165.109, "timestamp": "00:36:05", "text": "就像您知道的那样，我们会尽力提供帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2168.349, "timestamp": "00:36:08", "text": "互相支持，共同成长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2171.87, "timestamp": "00:36:11", "text": "团结一致，不要竞争，不要这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2174.47, "timestamp": "00:36:14", "text": "竞争关系只是让大家一起玩得开心而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2176.99, "timestamp": "00:36:16", "text": "一起玩游戏，玩得开心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2181.15, "timestamp": "00:36:21", "text": "等等，那正是我想要的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2184.95, "timestamp": "00:36:24", "text": "但事情并非总是如此。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2188.069, "timestamp": "00:36:28", "text": "不是那种快乐的、无忧无虑的快乐，或者像那种快乐的……呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2190.03, "timestamp": "00:36:30", "text": "永远幸福"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2193.63, "timestamp": "00:36:33", "text": "后。所以，然后我就有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2196.95, "timestamp": "00:36:36", "text": "感觉很糟糕，是的，我学到了这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2199.91, "timestamp": "00:36:39", "text": "艰难的方法。她的生活并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2201.39, "timestamp": "00:36:41", "text": "它不是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2201.76, "timestamp": "00:36:41", "author": "@N_I_R_NASHAK", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1tUEQ85FwbdYgcMSwBtAKUjwpzN8k-JYCUeDTQQXUvSFn0hVEvGSW0HPICJMtxNg5tVEcjZ-cOc=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i mean who else is covering in vtubing literally no one you did and good job you did the best but what else can we say the space is small and planet type like there's no big co op in space"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2212.282, "timestamp": "00:36:52", "author": "@N_I_R_NASHAK", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1tUEQ85FwbdYgcMSwBtAKUjwpzN8k-JYCUeDTQQXUvSFn0hVEvGSW0HPICJMtxNg5tVEcjZ-cOc=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "we're still figuring stuff out tho"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2212.79, 